line	<col=000080>Climb up and kill the <col=800000>H.A.M. Mage</col> and <col=800000>H.A.M. Archer</col>, you must use magic or ranged. Throwing <col=800000>dart</col>s can work, only if you use the "long range" combat style. If you forgot a magic or ranged weapon, a crossbow and 50 bronze bolts spawns just to the west of your character upstairs.</col>
