line	<str>Talk to General Wartface or General Bentnoze to receive ancient mace and two goblin warriors</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Lumbridge Swamp Cave entrance (outside by the giant frogs in Lumbridge Swamp)</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to one of the goblin sergeants.</str>
line	
line	<str>Read the following steps before doing them as this next section is time sensitive.</str>
line	
line	<str>#Enter the caves then climb down the nearby ladder.</str>
line	
line	<str>#As soon as you're down, talk to the sergeants and tell one of them to wait.</str>
line	
line	<str>#Run to the room and enter.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>#Wait for 2 <col=800000>guards</col> to pass.</col>
step	22	-	Quick guide step 22
line	<str>Speak to Ur-tag or Ambassador Alvijar in the north-east part of Dorgesh-Kaan's middle level.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to the south-west corner of the city's middle level.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the doorway with the transportation symbol on the minimap.</str>
line	
line	<str>Walk south on the tracks and talk to Tegdak.</str>
line	
line	<str>Dig up artefacts from the ground with the trowel (there are six artefacts total).</str>
line	
line	<str>Use artefacts on the specimen table to clean them.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Tegdak. Zanik will automatically follow you after (if you don't have a follower already).</str>
line	
line	<str>Make sure Zanik is following you.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Goblin scribe in the house west of Ur-tag where you started the quest.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Oldak in the north-west corner of the city's lower level (there are stairs down in the house west of the scribe) to teleport to the Goblin Village.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to General Wartface or Bentnoze. A cutscene will start.</str>
line	
line	<str>Run south to the ladder, stay behind the houses on the west side to not get hit.</str>
